From 4372135d13f6831edc5335e712d4119fe0bbd0bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MeshMesh <noreply@meshmesh.io>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 21:56:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate to Heroku with Gemini AI backend

- Add Express server (server.js) with Gemini API proxy, tool-calling
  support, image generation, scraping, and tracker endpoints
- Rewrite llm.js to use same-origin /api/llm instead of SF LLM Gateway
- Remove all BYOK/API key management from frontend (app.js, index.html)
- Replace Cloudflare Worker tracker with /api/track endpoint
- Add Procfile, package.json, and key sync script for Heroku deployment
- Server binds to :: (IPv6 dual-stack) for Heroku Fir Private Spaces
